Another idea I just had:  add in some spellbooks for intrinsics that could
be learned.  For example, add one that, when read, gives you the ability
to identify stones, like the archaeologist, but not one that would give
you fire resistance.  The following intrinsics could be gained:

	identify stones
	identify cursed/uncursed/blessed state of items
	searching
	identify weapons/armor
	identify magical enchantment

plus others I probably haven't thought of yet.  There could also be books that
act like a potion of gain ability, i.e., a book on beauty tips raises your
charisma by one, a science book raises your intelligence, a holy book raises
your wisdom, etc.

